close_reason: "Fixed: telemetry consent and the event endpoint live only in the global profile. The init wizard records its answer there and writes no project telemetry block. The scope-less telemetry-tracking shorthand and MCP target the global profile, and project scope refuses. PM_TELEMETRY_ENDPOINT points opted-in tests at a local collector through an isolated queue."
